track 10 of Unbreakable Momentum
Instrumental-only dark synth-rock / rock track at 86 BPM built around a single, unwavering groove that never yields, Drums are steady and confident—driving kick, firm snare, and restrained hi-hats maintaining a deep, immovable pocket, Bass repeats a grounded, forceful motif that anchors the track without variation, reinforcing inevitability, Guitars and synths hold consistent tones and phrasing, looping short, declarative riffs that project endurance rather than intensity, Harmonic movement is minimal and unresolved, emphasizing permanence over tension, No vocals, no drops, no chaos—the track persists unchanged, resilient, and unbreakable
